  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "You ran git clean and your files vanished?"
  },
  {
   "id": "bug",
   "text": "Most devs panic here."
  },
  {
   "id": "why",
   "text": "Untracked files were never committed, so Git cannot bring them back."
  },
  {
   "id": "fix",
   "text": "Run git clean dash f d n first. It is a dry run, so it only lists what would go. Looks right? Then delete, or use dash i to pick."
  },
  {
   "id": "bait",
   "text": "Dry run first, or alias to dash i? Comment your answer."
  },
  {
   "id": "follow",
   "text": "Follow K four coding for part five."
